## 3. Verification Results

### Automatic Testing
- **Unit Tests**: Created for critical financial modules ([TaxService](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/services/api/src/compliance/tax.ts#27-46)) and risk modules ([FraudEngine](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/services/api/src/risk/fraud-engine.ts#23-73)).
- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions pipeline defined in [.github/workflows/deploy.yml](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/.github/workflows/deploy.yml).

### Manual Validation Walkthrough

#### A. Guest Checkout Flow
1. **User lands**: Sees high-fidelity "Glassmorphism" UI ([design-system.css](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/styles/design-system.css)).
2. **Browses Stores**: [StoreList](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/StoreList.tsx#11-62) page shows nearby options.
3. **Adds items**: [ProductDetail](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/ProductDetail.tsx#14-69) shows mandatory "Sold By [Store]" disclosure.
4. **Optimizes**: [SmartCartEngine](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/services/api/src/optimization/engine.ts#22-108) runs Haversine dist + Price comparison.
5. **Checkout**: `StripeService.createPaymentIntent` tags `transfer_group` for split payout.

#### B. Merchant Onboarding & Ops
1. **Sign Up**: [MerchantLayout](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/layouts/MerchantLayout.tsx#7-61) protects route.
2. **Product Mgmt**: Merchant adds inventory via [ProductManager.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/merchant/ProductManager.tsx).
3. **Order Mgmt**: Merchant accepts order in [OrderManager.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/merchant/OrderManager.tsx), satisfying State Machine rules.

#### C. Admin & Compliance
1. **Safety**: Admin uses [UserManagement.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/admin/UserManagement.tsx) to ban bad actors.
2. **Audit**: [AuditLogs.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/admin/AuditLogs.tsx) provides immutable record of financial events.
3. **Accessibility**: Color contrast verified in [ACCESSIBILITY.md](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/docs/ACCESSIBILITY.md) (AA Standard).

